{"quest_id": 6558, "name": "大怪盗からの予告状", "description": "予告状を出し、王子たちを呼び出した\nサバル。大怪盗として、更なる飛躍を\n望む彼女が口にした頼みとは……？\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ゴールドラッシュ21(2018)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300204, "map_no": 3452, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 300, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"card": 21, "c": 1}, {"card": 55, "c": 2}, {"item": 1006, "c": 1}, {"card": 254}], "capacity": 9, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 32, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 130, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 130, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097536, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 28, "global_id": 27}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 130, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 130, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1100.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2103520, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 453, "global_id": 452, "spawn_sec": 41}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4600, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 4600, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2112368, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 31225, "global_id": 4844, "spawn_sec": 78}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 42, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108544, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30131, "global_id": 3750, "spawn_sec": 100}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 90, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 90, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 51, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2112064, "race_id": 12, "missile_id": 113, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 30645, "global_id": 4264, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 135}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "サバルさんの予告状に書かれていた地図、\n大体このあたりでしょうか……？"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "おっ、きたきた。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "サバル、この予告状っていうのは、\nいったい何のつもりなんだ？", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "ん……ちょっと付き合ってほしいことがあってさ。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "付き合ってほしいこと？\nどうしたんだ急にかしこまって。", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "かしこまりもするさ。\nちょっと変わったお願いなんだから。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "――率直に言って、私にはまだ、\n足りないものがあると思うのさ。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "サバルさんに、足りないものですか……？"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "そう、このサバル様が真の意味で、\n大怪盗って呼ばれるには、\nやっぱりひとつ、足りないものがあるんだ。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "つまりは、予告状を出した上で、\n王子たちの厳重な警備を突破して、\n華麗に盗みを成功させた伝説がなくっちゃ！", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "なるほど、その為に予告状を……。"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "だからお願いだ、王子。\n全力で私の盗みに対抗してほしい！", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "ありがとう王子。それじゃあ見事に、\n王子の大事なものを盗んでみせるからね！", "face": "u536"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "サバル", "text": "うぅ、また盗めなかったぁ……。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "そういえば、\nサバルは何を盗もうとしたんだ？", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "えっ？　そりゃ王子の……って！\nなんでもない！　なんでもないって！\nにゃはははは……。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………？", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "ま、まぁでも、おかげで盗みの技を極める、\n良いきっかけが出来た気がするよ。", "face": "u536"}, {"name": "サバル", "text": "天下の大怪盗目指して頑張るから、\n今後も予告状には気をつけるんだよ♪", "face": "u536"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map3452", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 160, "y": 322}, {"k": "m", "x": 79, "y": 432, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 322, "y": 441, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 274, "y": 279, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 195, "y": 384, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 459, "y": 473, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 336, "y": 186, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 405, "y": 95, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 531, "y": 94, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 653, "y": 108, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 717, "y": 199, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 855, "y": 205, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 778, "y": 293, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 847, "y": 394, "id": 212}, {"k": "r", "x": 458, "y": 388, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 79, "y": 358, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 237, "y": 215, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 171, "y": 472, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 449, "y": 165, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 784, "y": 151, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 718, "y": 345, "id": 306}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "A Warning from the Great Thief", "description_en": "Saval, who sent a warning letter to summon the Prince\nand his party. What is the request made by her, who seeks\ngreater leaps as a great thief...? Intermediate (★1 target: Avg Lv1, 8 units deployed)"}